      { "page": 29, "top": 67, "bottom": 327 }
    ],
    "description": "Question 10 defines a sequence of dot patterns on the coordinate plane. H(n) is the total number of dots in Pattern n. Part (i) asks for H(1). For natural n, H(n + 1) = H(n) + 2n + 3. Part (ii) asks for an induction proof that H(n) = (n + 1)² for every natural n."
  },
